th="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.out3" value="&lt;b&gt;MQTT get_design/res · save_build/res&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;구조 · 레시피 · 블록 JSON / ok&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2224.0" y="889.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.out4" value="&lt;b&gt;DB db (SQL · psycopg)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;designs · builds&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2224.0" y="957.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.out5" value="&lt;b&gt;MQTT d2/web/alive&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;1초마다 (LWT)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2224.0" y="1010.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.out6" value="&lt;b&gt;WebSocket /ws → frontend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;상태 · 진행표 · 알림 · 연결 상태 · 음성 문장 밀어 줌&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2224.0" y="1063.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.out7" value="&lt;b&gt;REST 응답 → frontend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;목록 · 상세 · 트리 · 검사 결과 · 생성 결과 · 명령 결과&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2224.0" y="1130.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.st0" value="① REST 요청 → MQTT …/req(select_design · start · scan · cancel). 정지 · 다시 시작은 d2/safety/…/req로 바로 → …/res 결과를 REST 응답으로" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1698.0" y="710.0" width="480.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.st1" value="② retained 상태 · 진행표 · 알림 · 쥔 블록 · 연결 상태 · 음성 설계 요청 문장(d2/hmi/intent)을 WebSocket /ws로 frontend에 밀어 줌" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1698.0" y="775.0" width="480.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.st2" value="③ 정적 파일(frontend/out) 서빙 — 실행 시 Node 없음 · 시작 점검(브로커 · DB · 키) · 설계 목록 · 상세 · 트리 · 검사 결과를 REST 응답으로" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1698.0" y="825.0" width="480.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.st3" value="④ 요청 문장 + RAG 예시(같은 가구의 기본 설계 · 파생본 · 조립 결과) → GPT-4o: 튜닝(템플릿 · 숫자 → 코드가 배치) → 안 되면 자유 생성(블록 JSON)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1698.0" y="909.0" width="480.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backend.st4" value="⑤ check_design/req → …/res 실패 이유를 돌려줘 재생성(최대 2번) → 통과면 저장, 아