"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.in10" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/hmi/alive (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;웹 생존 신호 — 3초 끊기면 WAIT_HMI&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1382.0" y="2927.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out0" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/hmi/get_design (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;design_id → 구조 · 레시피 (다리가 답함)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2298.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out1" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/move_to (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;관측 · 공급 관측 · 홈 · 촬영 자세 2개 · speed_ratio&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2365.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out2" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/vision/check_progress (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;설계 이름(design_id) · 볼 블록 이름&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2432.0" width="210.0" height="72.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out3" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/vision/find_blocks (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;run_id → 흩어진 블록 목록&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2514.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out4" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/pick_place (액션)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;블록 1개 목표 · open_width_m&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2582.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out5" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/vision/scan_capture · scan_infer (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;촬영 · 추론 요청&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2635.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out6" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/safety/stop (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;TIMEOUT 때 먼저 세움 (source task)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2703.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out7" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/state (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;상태 · 알림 글(공급 채우기 · 기울어진 블록 · 웹 끊김 · 정지 이유 · 완성)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2770.0" width="210.0" height="71.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out8" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/progress (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;진행표 → 장면 관리 · 다리 → 화면&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2851.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out9" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/scan_result (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;추론 설계 → 다리 → 화면 비교&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2904.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out10" value="&lt;b&gt;check_design 답&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;통과 · 이유 · 구조 · 레시피&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="2957.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out11" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/hmi/save_build (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;조립 결과(성공 · 오차 · 시간) → 다리&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2184.0" y="3010.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st0" value="① 명령 받기: 설계 선택 → get_design으로 레시피, 출발(버튼 · 음성 같게), 스캔, [계속], 취소. 4초(timeout.command_s) 안에 확정 못 하면 실행하지 않고 TIMEOUT" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2322.0" width="500.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st1" value="② 시작 점검(로봇 · 그리퍼 · 카메라 · 다리 연결 · 조립 자리 · 공급) → 관측 자세 move_to(observe)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2387.0" width="500.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st2" value="③ 확인 부탁 check_progress(설계 이름 · 블록 이름) → 답을 TaskPlanner에" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2437.0" width="500.0" height="25.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st3" value="④ 공급 관측 자세 move_to(observe_supply) → find_blocks → 고른 블록을 pick_place 목표로 → 결과 → 블록마다 ②③. 블록 0개면 WAIT_SUPPLY · 기울어진 블록만 남으면 알림 tilted_block → [계속]. 대비책: 공급 칸 6개" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2472.0" width="500.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st4" value="⑤ 스캔: observe → observe_front → observe_side 자세마다 scan_capture → scan_infer → scan_result 방송 → SCAN_REVIEW(저장 뒤 select_design → READY · scan = 다시 · cancel → IDLE)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2537.0" width="500.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st5" value="⑥ 멈춤이면 STOPPED → 다시 시작 → 쥔 블록 확인 → 진행 확인부터(첫 move_to speed_ratio 0.5). 웹 끊김(/d2/hmi/alive 3초)이면 현재 블록까지 놓고 WAIT_HMI → [계속]" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2602.0" width="500.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st6" value="⑦ 시간 제한(robot.yaml timeout.*) 서비스 3초 · move_to 45초 · pick_place 90초 → 넘으면 TIMEOUT: 먼저 세움(pick_place 목표 취소 · move_to는 safety/stop source task) → 사람 호출" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2667.0" width="500.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st7" value="⑧ 관측 결과 ↔ 레시피(블록 이름 역할_부품_블록) → 진행표(있음 · 없음 · 높이 · 오차 측정값) → progress 방송" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2766.0" width="500.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st8" value="⑨ 다음 블록 = sequence 첫 미배치(받침 있음) · 설계 좌표 + 조립 원점 → 로봇 좌표" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2816.0" width="500.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st9" value="⑩ BlockPicker: 가장 잡기 쉬운 블록(E-46) — 놓을 자세와 같음 · 틈 gap_mm ≥ 22.2 mm(E-49) · 겹침 없음(없으면 위) · 덮임 · 기울어짐 뺌 → pick_pose · grasp · open_width_m" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2866.0" width="500.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st10" value="⑪ 블록 JSON 검사: 형식 · 파고듦 · 받침 · 안정성(무게중심 여유 7 mm, 쌓는 도중) · 잡기 틈 · 막힌 칸 · 작업영역" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2965.0" width="500.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st11" value="⑫ 통과면 변환기 ①(blocks_to_recipe, 레시피 도구) → 구조 + 레시피 → 답(통과 · 이유 · 구조 · 레시피)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3015.0" width="500.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st12" value="⑬ run_id(R&lt;날짜&gt;_&lt;시각&gt;_&lt;16진 4자&gt;) CSV 직접 쓰기 → 끝나면 save_build(다리 → 웹)로 builds" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3099.0" width="500.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c0" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.218;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="task.in0" target="task.st0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1602.0" y="2333.5"/><mxPoint x="1602.0" y="2334.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.218;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="task.in1" target="task.st0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1610.0" y="2407.5"/><mxPoint x="1610.0" y="2334.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColo