style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;관절값 · 좌표 · 그리퍼 값 · 속도&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3786.0" y="2515.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.out0" value="&lt;b&gt;move_group (MoveIt2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;경로 계획 · 실행&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4408.0" y="2298.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.out1" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/gripper/command (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;폭 · 힘&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4408.0" y="2351.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.out2" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/motion/scene/attach (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;붙이기 · 떼기&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4408.0" y="2404.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.out3" value="&lt;b&gt;중간 보고 · 결과&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;step · 성공 · 실패 코드&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4408.0" y="2472.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st0" value="① approach — 집을 블록 위로 (0.08 m) · 흩어진 블록 pick_pose(대비책 공급 칸)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4042.0" y="2298.0" width="320.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st1" value="② grasp — 여는 폭 open_width_m(0이면 robot.yaml 값) · 손가락 끝 높이(grasp_depth 11 mm) 계산 → 내려가서 닫기(10 N), 잡혔는지 확인" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4042.0" y="2348.0" width="320.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st2" value="③ attach — 쥔 블록을 팔에 붙임" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4042.0" y="2428.0" width="320.0" height="25.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st3" value="④ lift → move → place — 쌓인 블록 피해서 위치 제어로 놓기" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4042.0" y="2463.0" width="320.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st4" value="⑤ detach — 놓은 블록으로 되돌림 → 0.001 m 천천히 수직 → retreat" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4042.0" y="2513.0" width="320.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pick_place.st5" value="⑥ 결과 — 성공 · 실패 코드 · 그리퍼 폭 · 걸린 시간" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;white